Harden the settings file reader.

Our own patch (AvP). Upstream master at 2959d5c2 still has the code this
replaces. See the comments in the code.

- Trim a setting's name one character at a time, not with a sum that relies
  on a number wrapping around past zero.
- Give isspace and isalnum a value from 0 to 255. An accented letter in a
  settings file used to reach them as a negative number.
- Check the folders from HOME and XDG_CONFIG_HOME the way XDG_CONFIG_DIRS is
  checked already: tidy the path up, and ignore one that is not complete.

